Description: Fast, private web browser with built-in ad blocking
 Flint is a fast, private, batteries-included web browser by Dhiva Labs.
 .
 Built-in EasyList/EasyPrivacy ad and tracker blocking at the network
 level, DNS-over-HTTPS with selectable providers, multi-connection
 turbo downloads with pause and resume, reader mode, private windows,
 HTTPS-first mode, session restore, and zero telemetry.
